    "https://careers.hprod.onehcm.usg.edu/psc/careers/CAREERS/HRMS/c/HRS_HRAM_FL.HRS_CG_SEARCH_FL.GBL?FOCUS=Applicant&SiteId=83000": {
      "title": "University of Middle Georgia Careers",
      "description": "Careers Skip to Main Content Press Control+M to start dragging object ptnbsid=GjpJDRtAt7KPg3tn3gkZEynvte0%3d Back University of Middle Georgia Careers Search Category Name Search keywords Search in... Menu Category All Company Directory Job Data No results to display Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Title Actions Search My Preferences Help Sign Out University of Middle Georgia Careers More Actions Welcome Sign In New User Thank you for your interest in employment at Middle Georgia State University. You can search and review job openings from this page without creating an account with us. When you are ready to apply, login or create a new applicant account. You can access this applicant portal on your desktop, laptop, or any mobile device, and you will be able to: View all job opportunities Search on specific criteria to find jobs that interest you Set up a search agent that will notify you when positions are posted that match your search criteria For technical support or questions regarding a job application, please contact the USG Service Desk at (877) 251-2644 or support@usg.edu . Due to an Oracle Known Issue, Mac OS users are advised to browse and apply for jobs using a web browser other than Safari. The Jeanne Clery Campus Safety Act and the Higher Education Act (HEA) fire safety provisions require institutions of higher education to publish an Annual Security Report and Annual Fire Safety Report. These reports include crime and fire statistics for the three most recently completed calendar years, institutional policies and procedures for reporting crimes, and current policies concerning the security of, and access to, campus facilities and residences, as well as security considerations in the maintenance of campus facilities. The reports are available online at: https://www.mga.edu/police/docs/Annual_Security_Report.pdf . If you would like to retain a copy of the report, you may print it from your browser or request a paper copy by emailing the institution at police@mga.edu . View All Jobs My Job Notifications My Job Applications My Favorite Jobs My Saved Searches My Account Information University of Middle Georgia Careers Sign In New User"
    },
    "https://www.mga.edu/human-resources/jobs/index.php": {
      "title": "Career Opportunities",
      "description": "Career Opportunities: Middle Georgia State University Skip to Content Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Visit Apply Give Search Search MGA Directory Offices & Services News Events Library D2L SWORDS Email MyMGA About About MGA Directory Offices & Services Leadership Publications Visit MGA Campus Tours Campus Maps & Directions Campuses Cochran Dublin Eastman Macon Warner Robins Online Academics Academics Degrees & Programs Academic Calendar Departments Academic Catalog Register for Classes Honors Program Resources Advisor Library Continuing Education Student Success Center Bookstore Writing Center MARC Schools School of Arts & Letters School of Aviation School of Business School of Computing School of Education & Behavioral Sciences School of Health Sciences The Graduate School Admissions Undergraduate Admissions First Time Freshmen High School Students International Students Transfer Students Graduate Admissions Apply to a Program Resources Orientation Check Application Status Academic Calendar Accepted Student Checklist Contact Your Recruiter Tuition & Costs Tuition & Costs Financial Aid Tuition Estimate Calculator Scholarships Pay Your Balance Student Life Campus Activities Events on Campus Clubs & Organizations Housing & Residence Life Residence Halls Apply Housing Requirement Resources Internships & Career Planning Counseling Services Health Clinic Knight Alert Athletics Career Opportunities Human Resources Jeanne Clery Disclosure Student Hiring Student Employees Federal Work Study Student Employees Internal Hiring Career Opportunities Welcome to Middle Georgia State University – Where Great People Thrive We are excited you are here! At MGA, we do not just offer jobs  —  we offer purpose, growth, and a workplace culture that has been nationally recognized as a Great College to Work For. Our team is made up of passionate individuals who bring their best every day, and we are always looking for talented people like you to join us. Ready to find your place? Let’s get started. Please click on the links below to view our job opportunities and to apply. Internal Job Openings ( MGA Employees Only ) Faculty, Staff, and Student Job Openings As a member of our faculty and staff, you will collaborate with others in an effort to be great in all we do — not just in how we educate students, but in how we interact with everyone who comes in contact with the university. Whether you are just starting your career or looking to take the next big step, explore how your future can flourish here. Discover opportunities, meet our people, and see why working at MGA is more than a job — it is a place to belong, grow, and make a difference. MGA is an equal employment opportunity employer. MGA participates in E-Verify to confirm the identity and employment eligibility of all persons hired to work in the United States. REQUEST INFO VISIT MGA APPLY NOW About MGA Contact Us Maps & Directions Careers Current Students Financial Aid Mental Health Safety Accreditation Compliance, Ethics & Reporting Line Title IX Compliance Human Trafficking Notice Web Accessibility Web Privacy Macon Cochran Dublin Eastman Warner Robins Online Copyright © 2026 Middle Georgia State University Macon Cochran Dublin Eastman Warner Robins Online Copyright © 2026 Middle Georgia State University"
    }
